  "scope_note": "This does not make the seller perform, does not verify delivery (fulfillment_receipt.py), does not prove the counterparty is external (counterparty_role.py), does not bind the payment to the order (order_bound_amount.py) and does not reconcile two disagreeing records (divergence_note.py). It makes the worst case of a paid call a number a policy can compare against a ceiling, before any money moves.",
